      "message": "Right now, most boards implement this function almost identically. This would be a bigger lift, but I think most of the logic here could be made generic and put in `tcpm.h` and `tcpci.c`.\n\nThe register parsing logic should be identical for all TCPCs implementing TCPCI. The GPIO-to-port mapping is board-specific, and `pd_interrupt_handler_task` could call into that. We typically have an interrupt line and an interrupt task for each port, so it doesn\u0027t really make sense for one task to be checking both GPIOs anyway.",
